cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  CrossClimatePV: A Controlled Multi-Climate Benchmark Showing Climate Outweighs Every Dataset Artifact Tested in Photovoltaic Power Forecasting
message: >-
  If you use CrossClimatePV, please cite both this software release and
  the paper listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
authors:
