    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6403-7748'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/shahoismael/crossclimatepv'
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21918702
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21918702
    description: Zenodo archive of the v1.1.0 release
abstract: >-
  A harmonized cross-climate benchmark for photovoltaic power
  forecasting. Four public archives spanning five Koppen climate
  zones and 345 scored sites are reduced to one schema, one
  chronological split, one common feature set and one evaluation
  protocol, so that models can be compared across climates rather
  than on a single convenience site. Ships the frozen protocol
  definitions, per-site capacity normalization constants,
  rare-event labels, five baselines and all per-site results.
keywords:
  - photovoltaic power forecasting
  - cross-climate generalization
  - benchmark
  - Koppen climate zones
  - rare-event forecasting
  - forecast skill score
  - transfer learning
  - reproducibility
